Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.44,0:00:17.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,左眼几乎没有视力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.57,0:00:21.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,角膜移植准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.76,0:00:24.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我会用带子固定住眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:37.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,先放进去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.75,0:00:47.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥 还是别做了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:49.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.13,0:00:52.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,因为今天突然就要手术
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.92,0:00:56.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,原来你害怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.17,0:00:58.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,都这样了 你还说这个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.75,0:00:59.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.69,0:01:02.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我自己无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:05.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可你的左眼会看不见吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:09.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我还是不愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:11.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.71,0:01:13.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.29,0:01:16.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.21,0:01:19.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我已经决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.08,0:01:23.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爸妈去世时 我就决定由我照顾你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.21,0:01:26.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可也不能这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.21,0:01:26.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.98,0:01:29.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你就把插画画好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.75,0:01:31.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.62,0:01:34.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你很有天赋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.43,0:01:35.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,努力成为职业画师
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.82,0:01:38.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.99,0:01:51.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我要解开带子了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.03,0:01:59.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,给您脸上盖块布
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.03,0:02:14.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,手术马上开始
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.45,0:02:18.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,激光手术刀准备 OK
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.81,0:02:56.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你是滨田刚吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.90,0:02:57.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.97,0:03:40.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,跟总部的人联合办案 真没意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.85,0:03:43.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好处全被他们抢走了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.39,0:03:44.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我很强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.50,0:03:45.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我能行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.90,0:03:47.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一定抓到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.10,0:03:48.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,大内 你在听吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.39,0:03:49.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我很强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.03,0:03:50.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我能行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.00,0:03:51.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我很强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:51.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我能行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.92,0:03:52.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我很强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.49,0:03:53.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我能行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:54.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我很强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.48,0:03:55.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.69,0:03:56.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,突入
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.69,0:03:58.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,各位 全员行动
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:03:59.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.42,0:04:29.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好 别动
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.79,0:04:31.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,开枪了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.50,0:04:32.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:34.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.88,0:04:35.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.04,0:04:37.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.09,0:04:38.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.21,0:04:39.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:42.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.88,0:04:47.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快抓住他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.61,0:05:02.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那小子真能打
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.83,0:05:18.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我很强
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.85,0:05:20.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一定能逮捕他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.49,0:05:37.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我很强
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:38.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,很强
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:39.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,很强
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.71,0:05:41.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对 我很强
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.18,0:05:43.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.71,0:05:48.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我很强
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.91,0:05:49.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.93,0:05:51.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那家伙已经没在看了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.40,0:05:53.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,逮捕
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.40,0:05:54.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,逮捕了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.19,0:05:58.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.19,0:06:00.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,已经逮捕了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.42,0:06:12.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要能扣押这东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.75,0:06:19.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,田中先生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.97,0:06:22.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,田中爱之助先生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.51,0:06:33.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请慢慢眨眼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.97,0:06:47.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在戴上眼罩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.38,0:06:55.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好了 结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.65,0:07:06.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,咦 我哥呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.97,0:07:08.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他已经先回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.41,0:07:10.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.70,0:07:23.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这些设备全是专为你的手术准备的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.86,0:07:25.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是你哥哥专门安排的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.08,0:07:28.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.08,0:07:53.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,密码
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.12,0:07:54.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,密码
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.13,0:07:58.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那台电脑的密码呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.40,0:07:59.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.73,0:08:01.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,都说我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.40,0:08:04.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别整晚问同一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.29,0:08:09.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们本来要请国外的电脑专家破解
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.12,0:08:11.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,出价1亿日元
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.17,0:08:13.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,骗子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.89,0:08:18.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这台电脑属于日本最抢手的犯罪策划人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.42,0:08:22.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,若 1 亿 2 亿就够 我愿意出资
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.16,0:08:34.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是别村那家伙的 那里也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.87,0:08:53.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没有锁链
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.11,0:08:54.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,防盗用的锁链
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.59,0:08:57.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有这种东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.59,0:08:58.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没有 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.28,0:08:59.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:00.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我的自行车锁链倒是有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.59,0:09:02.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快拿来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.33,0:09:06.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,做完后 这房间只准搜查科的人进入
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.87,0:09:07.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.78,0:09:08.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.74,0:09:12.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.55,0:09:27.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,地方警署可斗不过本厅来的那些人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.63,0:09:30.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,扣押电脑也是大内的功劳吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:32.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,大内 你去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.74,0:09:33.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.57,0:09:35.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,去拿锁链
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.70,0:09:38.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你要把自己的锁链借给他们？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.34,0:09:39.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你也太老好人了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.31,0:09:41.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.31,0:09:43.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,容我说一句
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.07,0:09:45.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,靠自我催眠没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.72,0:09:48.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但别再像上次那样乱来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.34,0:09:49.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你真会送命的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.94,0:09:50.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.70,0:09:51.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.45,0:09:52.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我会小心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.70,0:09:54.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那我去拿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.09,0:10:34.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.29,0:10:36.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我看见了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.21,0:10:41.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.17,0:12:04.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,或许暂时不能给你寄生活费了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.79,0:12:07.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,以防万一 先把这些给你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.87,0:12:12.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,身为哥哥 本该陪着你 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.55,0:12:14.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我支持你画插画
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.99,0:12:16.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥留
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.82,0:12:57.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.91,0:12:59.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.47,0:13:33.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊 哥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.15,0:13:35.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在无法接听电话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.19,0:13:41.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请在提示音后 20 秒内留下姓名和事情
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.92,0:13:45.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.48,0:13:47.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在工作？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.92,0:13:50.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还在研究室吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.92,0:13:55.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看完信 我总觉得不放心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.84,0:13:59.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你写了“对不起” 我不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.77,0:14:03.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我看了信封 出什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.81,0:14:06.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥 这些钱哪来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.49,0:14:08.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就当是给弟弟的 不行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.57,0:14:11.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别管了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.97,0:14:13.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.97,0:14:17.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,总之 我的左眼已经能看见了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.53,0:14:21.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有 我一直没认真说过吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.74,0:14:24.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 哥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.98,0:14:28.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真的谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.31,0:15:50.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我最不擅长处理这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.31,0:15:51.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太可怜了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.41,0:15:53.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要不我去？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.43,0:15:55.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不用
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.43,0:15:59.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,再难受 该做的工作也得做
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.75,0:16:01.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我能行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.49,0:16:02.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我很强
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.49,0:16:03.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,能行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.40,0:16:04.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,能行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.68,0:16:07.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.95,0:16:08.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.51,0:16:10.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他往那边去了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:12.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好身手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.80,0:16:14.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你那边人有点多
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.79,0:16:17.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.66,0:17:04.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.42,0:17:20.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是意外吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.15,0:17:23.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.98,0:17:30.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真的是意外吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.48,0:17:33.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这绝对不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.99,0:17:37.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我哥不像我 不会因粗心出意外
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.91,0:17:40.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,鉴证科也查过 没有案件嫌疑…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.23,0:17:42.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可不对劲就是不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.71,0:17:46.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警官 你看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.34,0:17:48.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,信里还夹了 200 万
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.27,0:17:49.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我也不知道为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.02,0:17:52.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我不知道发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.12,0:17:56.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我哥肯定知道自己会遇到危险
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.73,0:18:00.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警官 求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.47,0:18:03.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请再仔细查一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.32,0:18:07.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.41,0:18:10.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我会再认真确认
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.63,0:18:29.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我又确认了一遍你哥哥的事 确实是意外事故
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.24,0:18:32.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,鉴证科也出了正式报告
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.88,0:18:36.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,差不多该告别了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.68,0:18:39.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你还年轻
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.74,0:18:41.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,希望你尽快振作
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.46,0:18:44.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,今后连同哥哥那一份一起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.41,0:18:46.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,积极地活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.46,0:18:55.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,来 小黑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.01,0:18:56.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.42,0:18:58.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.42,0:18:59.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,住手吧 哥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.49,0:19:03.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们一起加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.46,0:19:06.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别哭
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.58,0:19:10.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我最喜欢你的画了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.67,0:19:14.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们永远在一起吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.26,0:19:24.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.59,0:19:34.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这小鬼是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.58,0:19:37.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你那眼神什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.98,0:19:41.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我的眼睛怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.73,0:19:42.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.70,0:19:45.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是哥哥给我的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.18,0:19:48.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么 你有意见吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.78,0:19:51.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可别死了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.06,0:19:58.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:00.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也太弱了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.26,0:20:34.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.16,0:20:48.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.64,0:20:51.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这个月真的要完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.21,0:20:56.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,六十七万？那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.09,0:21:01.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就是普拉达那个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.69,0:21:03.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,呃 还有古驰的那几个
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.22,0:21:05.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊 还有爱马仕的包
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.65,0:21:08.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且还不止一个
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.13,0:21:11.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊 怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.22,0:21:15.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,烦死了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.71,0:21:18.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一烦躁就想买东西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.59,0:21:31.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哦 爱之助 最近怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.65,0:21:33.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,最近怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.11,0:21:36.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 你也挺不容易啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.33,0:21:37.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真不容易啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.01,0:21:40.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我在新闻上看到了 听说你连哥哥也没了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.79,0:21:43.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你这混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.05,0:21:46.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你这混蛋 王八蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.62,0:22:11.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.48,0:22:26.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.02,0:22:29.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别小看——
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.95,0:22:30.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.04,0:22:32.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,住 住手……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.58,0:22:33.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.64,0:22:35.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你这混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.38,0:22:37.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.10,0:22:43.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.08,0:22:52.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,搞什么啊 我正准备逆转取胜呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.64,0:22:55.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你都流血了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.27,0:22:58.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,三对一怎么可能赢得了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.38,0:23:00.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么可能赢得了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.22,0:23:02.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要打架也得打得聪明点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.52,0:23:05.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你叫什么来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.18,0:23:07.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,田中爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.18,0:23:08.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对 爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.20,0:23:09.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.20,0:23:10.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么突然直呼我的名字……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.12,0:23:19.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你哥哥的事 我在今早的教职工会议上听说了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.10,0:23:22.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,事情这么突然 一定很难受吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.18,0:23:24.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,情绪也会变得不稳定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.24,0:23:33.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我会跟班主任说的 今天别勉强 就在这里休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.21,0:23:41.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,保健室在教室和学生之间
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.53,0:23:46.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,保健室也在学生和家庭之间
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.37,0:23:54.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我希望大家觉得 保健室就像一个柔软的靠垫
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.61,0:23:57.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你在听吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.63,0:23:58.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.67,0:24:00.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,糟了 快迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.27,0:24:02.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,鞋子……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.47,0:24:05.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.05,0:24:10.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.97,0:24:12.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我去上课了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.79,0:24:20.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是那六十七万 我该怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.57,0:24:23.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我该怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.08,0:24:25.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.41,0:24:27.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你不去上课吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.91,0:24:30.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师很了解身体方面的事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.64,0:24:33.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,毕竟我是保健老师嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.23,0:24:36.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,做了角膜移植后
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.79,0:24:40.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,捐献者看过的记忆也会随角膜一起转移吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.70,0:24:42.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.70,0:24:49.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我天生左眼几乎看不见 所以接受了角膜移植
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.32,0:24:54.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但从那以后 我有时会看见
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.19,0:24:56.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看见什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.59,0:25:00.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,奇怪的男人 面具
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.57,0:25:03.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,鸟和猪 还有莫名其妙的数字
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.31,0:25:07.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有公文包里的成捆钞票
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.45,0:25:10.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,成捆钞票？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.01,0:25:11.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.13,0:25:13.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,问老师的我真是个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.29,0:25:19.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,左眼里出现了成捆钞票
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.19,0:25:24.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,公文包里装着成捆钞票
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.79,0:25:27.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,成捆钞票
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.72,0:25:30.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,成捆钞票
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.65,0:25:33.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,成捆钞票？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.58,0:25:36.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,顺便提醒一下 主语是 he 或 she 时
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.79,0:25:39.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,完成时的 have 要变成 has 请注意
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.05,0:25:43.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这个也经常有人弄错 要注意
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.89,0:25:49.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,主语是 I 或 you 时用 have\N是 he 或 she 时用 has
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.05,0:25:52.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,以上就是完成时的用法
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.09,0:25:56.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那到底是什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.99,0:25:59.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,自从哥哥把左眼给我后
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.63,0:26:00.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,两次都看得很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.68,0:26:03.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,幻觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.68,0:26:05.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还是……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.24,0:26:14.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也许是哥哥看到过的影像？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.91,0:26:19.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果真是这样 哥哥就是卷入了什么犯罪
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.94,0:26:23.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,电话先挂了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.30,0:26:28.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,起立
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.94,0:26:35.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.84,0:26:37.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,田中同学
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.30,0:26:45.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,田中爱之助同学 你要回去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.70,0:26:46.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我头疼
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.70,0:26:47.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嘴上这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.89,0:26:50.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你其实是想回去自己调查吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.51,0:26:51.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,成捆钞票的那个……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.60,0:26:54.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不是那个 是你哥哥的事
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.68,0:26:58.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我可以帮你的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.08,0:27:00.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.28,0:27:02.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊 那真遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.39,0:27:03.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我明明有车
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.84,0:27:08.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且 大白天的 中学生在街上到处晃
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.58,0:27:10.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,肯定会被警察带走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.93,0:27:14.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有我这种大人在身边 就绝对安全
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.31,0:27:16.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我好歹也是老师
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.54,0:27:23.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,咦 那是我的车
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.60,0:27:23.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.90,0:27:26.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现代又可爱的法国风情
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.47,0:27:27.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,名字叫拉潘
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.71,0:27:29.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,法语里就是兔子的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.88,0:27:30.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是不是特别可爱？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.99,0:27:32.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我看到它的瞬间就心动了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.17,0:27:36.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我觉得我哥不是死于事故的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.49,0:27:42.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥是被谁骗了 又卷入了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.49,0:27:44.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,最后才死的 我是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.97,0:27:48.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 你根本没听我说话吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.27,0:27:53.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥不是那种会因疏忽引发煤气爆炸的人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.83,0:27:57.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哎呀 这么快就决定让我当助手了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.32,0:28:04.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.47,0:28:14.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那就向你对哥哥的这份心意致敬 出发吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.63,0:28:21.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.63,0:28:24.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥不是住在这里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.69,0:28:26.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一开始住了 3 个月
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.52,0:28:29.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但很快就说要一个人住 搬出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.69,0:28:35.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我说房租和伙食费都会变贵 他却说“没问题”
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.14,0:28:38.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,从那以后就再也没回来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.07,0:28:41.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊 你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.47,0:28:43.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.06,0:29:05.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥骗我说他住在宿舍
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.32,0:29:11.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他一定有不得不撒谎的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.61,0:29:12.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.32,0:29:17.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,比如说 是为了不让我卷入什么事情
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.21,0:29:41.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对了 我能问你一件事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.98,0:29:44.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你哥哥说“以防万一 先把这些送来”
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.51,0:29:52.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他说的“这些” 大概是多少钱？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.71,0:29:53.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,200 万
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.82,0:29:55.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,200 万？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.34,0:29:57.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.41,0:29:58.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你现在带着 200 万？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.45,0:30:04.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.45,0:30:06.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,靠老师的我才是笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.88,0:30:07.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,整整 200 万
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.88,0:30:10.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊 啊 等一下啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.25,0:30:11.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.88,0:30:15.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,总之 先找到哥哥真正住过的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.49,0:30:16.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么找？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.64,0:30:24.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我来想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.89,0:30:30.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.94,0:30:34.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这种时候就该借助大人的智慧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.07,0:30:42.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,今天 关于日本的反恐对策
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.70,0:30:44.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们请国立病毒研究中心
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.55,0:30:47.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所长杉森信宏先生来谈一谈
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.64,0:30:48.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.48,0:30:51.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,杉森先生
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.09,0:30:54.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,国内也存在使用生物武器发动恐怖袭击的危险吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.79,0:30:57.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我国也不能说绝对不会发生
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.21,0:31:01.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,最近 像 K2Z 病毒这样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.30,0:31:03.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只需微量 短时间内就能
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.42,0:31:07.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,夺走 1000 万人以上生命的可怕东西也出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.47,0:31:11.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们研究所一直在严格的管理体制下……
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.87,0:31:15.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊 那个研究中心 不就在大内先生家附近吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.18,0:31:17.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.58,0:31:20.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真亏您能住在那种危险建筑旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.29,0:31:22.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯 因为房租便宜嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.58,0:31:23.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不知不觉间
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.58,0:31:27.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,大内先生成了新型病毒的试用样本也说不定
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.58,0:31:28.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.58,0:31:29.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.67,0:31:31.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不 这可不是笑的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.82,0:31:32.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.38,0:31:32.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.79,0:31:33.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,大内先生
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.58,0:31:34.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.47,0:31:36.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,前几天爆炸事故死者的家属来了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.54,0:31:38.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.54,0:31:39.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊 是
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.82,0:31:54.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,田中梦人的弟弟到警署来了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.89,0:31:56.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.07,0:32:10.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,住址去问警察 不是再普通不过了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.78,0:32:11.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.78,0:32:12.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.18,0:32:13.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助同学
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.73,0:32:14.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.38,0:32:20.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我叫狭山瞳 是这孩子学校的保健老师
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.51,0:32:21.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是大内
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.51,0:32:22.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.29,0:32:23.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.38,0:32:29.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个 我想知道这孩子已故哥哥现在的住址
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.27,0:32:29.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.69,0:32:31.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,明明是兄弟 你不知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.54,0:32:35.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一直以为他住在公司的宿舍
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.09,0:32:40.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,田中君和已故哥哥从小在不同的家庭长大
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.67,0:32:41.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以就算从现在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.92,0:32:44.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以他想从现在开始好好了解哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.62,0:32:47.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,能告诉我住址吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.82,0:32:49.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,当然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.61,0:32:51.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.40,0:32:52.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我去查查
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.02,0:32:59.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,话说 刚才那位刑警是不是又酷又帅？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.70,0:33:01.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警察的收入高吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.61,0:33:08.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,逃犯的画像已经画好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.48,0:33:13.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好 发给所有警署
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.57,0:33:14.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.61,0:33:16.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,安全等级达到 3
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.65,0:33:18.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这次应该能解读出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.02,0:33:33.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.02,0:33:35.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只会出现我的信息
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.93,0:33:44.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,大内先生说 可以让两位进去
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.66,0:33:46.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.63,0:33:57.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.63,0:33:59.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,资料上只写了这些
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.57,0:34:00.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.86,0:34:04.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.86,0:34:05.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.97,0:34:09.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我在杂志上见过
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.38,0:34:11.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这里价值超过2亿日元吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.48,0:34:31.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,价值2亿日元的房子
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.36,0:34:32.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.52,0:34:35.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.52,0:34:36.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真宽敞
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.16,0:34:37.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不愧是豪宅
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.13,0:34:39.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.21,0:34:41.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥以前住在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.77,0:34:48.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,果然不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.25,0:34:51.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥不可能有 2 亿日元这种钱
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.37,0:34:56.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,浴室
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.25,0:35:02.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,步入式衣帽间
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.02,0:35:08.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也可以分期付款
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.95,0:35:14.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,分成两期 三期 四期都行
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.89,0:35:17.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好啦好啦 变成这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.22,0:35:19.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好啦好啦好啦好啦好啦好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.36,0:35:23.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯 喂？喂？嗯嗯 是我
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.07,0:35:27.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,上个月信用卡消费的38万4500日元
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.80,0:35:31.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,因为账户余额不足 自动扣款失败了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.16,0:35:35.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们已经寄出了再次催款单 那笔款您已经汇了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.32,0:35:37.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还没有
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.78,0:35:39.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请您尽快汇款
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.44,0:35:44.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没问题啦 毕竟我现在可是在价值2亿日元的房子里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.61,0:35:45.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.36,0:35:48.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以说 我说不定马上就能拿到一大笔钱
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.39,0:35:51.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢 到处都是金钱的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.04,0:35:52.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,总之没问题 先挂了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.28,0:35:56.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一下子被拉回现实了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.11,0:36:08.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道哥哥之前一直被关在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.35,0:36:13.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,被某个坏人命令着 强迫住在这里之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.86,0:36:17.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,然后哥哥被杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.98,0:36:21.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.18,0:36:22.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.82,0:36:27.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我发现了一件不得了的事
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.64,0:36:30.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.65,0:36:34.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这里既然是你哥哥的房子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.01,0:36:39.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那你继承以后 不就变成你的了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.07,0:36:44.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以说 我哥根本不可能买得起这么贵的房子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.40,0:36:45.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是……
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.86,0:36:49.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这里可能是那些坏人的据点
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.65,0:36:52.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.78,0:36:57.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有人来了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.23,0:37:25.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你好 我是杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.19,0:37:56.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 我知道你在里面 出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.31,0:38:08.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 打我
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.14,0:38:16.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我现在觉得好像又能看到了 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.84,0:38:22.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,之前只有被别人打的时候 我才能看到那些画面
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.43,0:38:35.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不 可是……我是老师 你是学生 只要这种关系还在 要我打你就有点……
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.47,0:38:41.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别啰嗦了 快打啊 你这个粗胳膊的欠债女
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.31,0:38:46.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太过分了 你都知道了？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.78,0:39:15.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,初次见面 我是地狱的红鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.81,0:39:23.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是你死去的哥哥托我带的话
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.97,0:39:28.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他说 让你赶紧忘了他 好好准备升学考试
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.02,0:39:29.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.45,0:39:33.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我哥才不可能说这种话
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.55,0:39:39.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂喂 兄弟情深是好事 但太过头可是会丢命的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.12,0:39:46.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,事到如今再挣扎也没用 死去的哥哥不会回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.57,0:39:49.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,比起那个 还是自己的命更重要吧？嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.63,0:39:52.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,果然是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.33,0:39:54.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.73,0:39:56.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥果然是被杀的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.19,0:40:02.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.03,0:40:07.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是你杀了他吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.48,0:40:28.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 很疼吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.68,0:40:31.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这下总该吸取点教训了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.68,0:40:37.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你再这样到处乱转 你哥哥可没法安心成佛
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.64,0:40:40.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你这混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.44,0:40:43.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.84,0:40:54.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真是个倔强的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.07,0:41:00.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我再好说话 也不会给你第三次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.12,0:41:07.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快逃 我们快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.68,0:41:16.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 您好
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.60,0:41:18.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 您好
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.72,0:41:21.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是警察吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.22,0:41:24.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在在“WAKUWAKU”门前 有个男孩受伤了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.25,0:41:25.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.85,0:41:32.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.81,0:41:36.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我本来还挺看好你的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.21,0:41:47.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,再完美的犯罪 有你这种男人也会被彻底毁掉
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.13,0:41:52.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,蠢货
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.81,0:41:59.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.65,0:42:06.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.81,0:42:08.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.81,0:42:10.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.96,0:42:13.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.45,0:42:15.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.45,0:42:21.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.79,0:42:23.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还在发抖
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.58,0:42:33.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.46,0:42:36.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯 总算没事
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.58,0:42:45.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我刚问过警察 他们说房间里已经没人了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.70,0:42:52.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,或许我们该放弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.02,0:42:56.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.82,0:42:59.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们可能真的会被杀
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.70,0:43:02.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我不会放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.34,0:43:09.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我想知道哥哥死亡的真正原因
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.30,0:43:12.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,无论如何都要知道
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.06,0:43:20.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.43,0:43:23.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他们像这样妨碍我们 警告我们
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.69,0:43:25.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也说明了一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.27,0:43:31.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,换个角度想 这也证明我们调查的方向是对的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.07,0:43:34.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来也快找到成捆钞票了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.27,0:43:41.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,把你在车里画的素描给我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.15,0:43:48.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我把这个复印一份吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.61,0:43:52.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这样分开行动时 我们也都能继续推理
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.91,0:43:58.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师就别再管了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.07,0:44:00.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.63,0:44:08.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对我来说 哥哥是世上唯一的亲人
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.11,0:44:10.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可老师甚至没见过他
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.11,0:44:18.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没必要为了一个陌生人继续冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.55,0:44:21.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.55,0:44:22.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是老师
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.83,0:44:26.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为了可爱的学生 我当然会努力
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.24,0:44:33.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,总之 今天先回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.24,0:44:39.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我现在脑子很乱 什么都思考不了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.94,0:45:28.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这些数字是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.86,0:45:34.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且还有四幅男人们比“V”手势的画
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.37,0:45:38.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,塔楼银行
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.24,0:45:42.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,塔楼银行门前的男人们
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.94,0:45:46.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,银行
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.09,0:45:54.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,呜……哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.22,0:45:57.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我可以一个人住在这里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.86,0:46:01.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,寄住在亲戚家 你也会不自在吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.36,0:46:05.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是……
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.10,0:46:08.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.33,0:46:15.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥总是这样 动不动就说“没事的”
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.04,0:46:18.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,比起这个 我更担心你
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.31,0:46:23.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可别因为独居寂寞就哭鼻子
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.65,0:46:25.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.90,0:46:36.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥的死 果然不是意外
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.84,0:46:38.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是你死去的哥哥托我转告你的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.27,0:46:43.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他说“赶快忘了我 认真准备升学考试”
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.51,0:46:47.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,事到如今再自暴自弃 哥哥也不会回来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.96,0:46:57.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.03,0:47:08.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一定会替你报仇
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.05,0:47:20.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,班会结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.82,0:47:21.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.82,0:47:22.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,肚子不疼吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.65,0:47:24.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,头疼也行
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.05,0:47:24.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,很痛吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.92,0:47:26.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你想去保健室吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.15,0:47:26.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.45,0:47:27.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.09,0:47:27.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.92,0:47:28.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我不想去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.30,0:47:34.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么啊 这台花里胡哨的电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.70,0:47:36.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太可爱了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.40,0:47:37.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是计算器
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.40,0:47:38.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我选的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.04,0:47:41.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,来 看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.18,0:47:44.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这说不定是接近真相的关键线索
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.28,0:47:49.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这个 这个 还有这个
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.03,0:48:02.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 这些都是你一直一个人找的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.97,0:48:03.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.83,0:48:07.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为了那捆钞票 也为了可爱的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.43,0:48:09.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我说过自己什么都愿意做 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.44,0:48:13.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我已经盯着复印件和电脑屏幕看了一整晚
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.84,0:48:15.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊 重点在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.63,0:48:16.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.35,0:48:20.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这 3 个背景里都有塔楼银行 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.12,0:48:23.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我把这些全查了一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.49,0:48:27.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,结果发现了一个惊人的共同点
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.83,0:48:34.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没想到 这几家银行全都……
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.23,0:48:35.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,发生过银行抢劫案
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.23,0:48:36.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.16,0:48:36.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你早就知道了？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.90,0:48:37.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.57,0:48:40.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看这个 看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.44,0:48:44.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.25,0:48:59.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且这 3 家都成功逃脱了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.48,0:49:00.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,很厉害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.02,0:49:04.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过 图上有 4 家
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.59,0:49:07.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,实际发生过银行抢劫的还只有 3 家
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.93,0:49:09.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.70,0:49:13.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这家银行会不会就是下一次抢劫的目标？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.65,0:49:14.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.65,0:49:17.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这些都找齐后 我本来想再说
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.59,0:49:21.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可塔楼银行在全国有 300 多家分店 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.71,0:49:24.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,查着查着 天都快亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.71,0:49:28.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以最后一家 我想现在就用这台电脑找出来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.82,0:49:29.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.35,0:49:32.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我不干了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.72,0:49:35.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我还想好好去上课
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.26,0:49:37.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.39,0:49:39.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你改变主意了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.16,0:49:39.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.51,0:49:40.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我不干了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.96,0:49:42.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我才不想知道那种真相
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.73,0:49:45.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是那捆钞票怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.24,0:49:48.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.10,0:49:51.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.10,0:49:56.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,因为这家银行可能马上就要遭抢了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.08,0:50:01.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是能查出来 不就可以事先提醒他们了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.82,0:50:04.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这样说不定还能拿到谢礼
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.14,0:50:05.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谁稀罕那个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.92,0:50:07.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,总之我不干了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.94,0:50:09.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.36,0:50:10.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不干了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.82,0:50:15.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,职员会议又无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.21,0:50:18.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还想去买东西 又去不了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.13,0:50:19.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个小鬼真让人火大
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.64,0:50:22.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.37,0:50:41.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊 在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.83,0:51:13.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.10,0:51:15.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,高木先生
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.69,0:51:18.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个 您好
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.69,0:51:22.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我想见分行行长
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.74,0:51:24.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您要见分行行长？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.24,0:51:25.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.20,0:51:27.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个 冒昧问一下 您是哪位？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.30,0:51:30.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不 没什么特别的身份
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.98,0:51:43.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,其实 我有非常重要的消息
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.79,0:51:44.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.28,0:51:44.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.53,0:51:46.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您说的消息是？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.59,0:52:10.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,都给我靠拢 集合到这里来
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.59,0:52:11.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 小子
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.18,0:52:14.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没听见吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.89,0:52:17.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我说集合到这里来
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.63,0:52:24.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,下一个想死的是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.55,0:52:26.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快点动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.33,0:52:36.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.61,0:52:53.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要把这个特别情报告诉分行行长
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.00,0:52:55.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一千万日元的债就能一笔勾销
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.75,0:52:58.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.31,0:53:10.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,出局
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.55,0:53:14.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,知 知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.35,0:53:19.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我怎么就是不擅长用电脑呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.09,0:53:25.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,大内家附近的研究中心登上这期周刊了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.59,0:53:29.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.99,0:53:31.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以您就不在乎吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.25,0:53:33.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那可是杀人病毒
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.67,0:53:34.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,完全没事
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.71,0:53:37.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也就是说 大内一直睡在这种东西旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.31,0:53:38.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.03,0:53:39.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.51,0:53:43.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我都没注意到
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.21,0:53:45.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.59,0:53:47.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一直都在提醒您啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.91,0:53:51.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,日出町的塔楼银行发生抢劫案
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.11,0:53:56.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这孩子真冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.07,0:53:57.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.43,0:53:59.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你 带我去金库
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.95,0:54:00.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,带路
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.92,0:54:09.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等 先等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.07,0:54:13.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.71,0:54:19.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可恶 看不见
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.35,0:54:27.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 等着
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.99,0:54:30.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别再做这种毫无意义的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.03,0:54:35.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真是个奇怪的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.32,0:54:38.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,刚才已经有一个人中枪了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.38,0:54:39.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们没看见吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.29,0:54:53.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.39,0:54:55.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,保险箱？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.29,0:55:08.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,保险箱里究竟有什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.76,0:55:16.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.91,0:55:19.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 看这边
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.47,0:55:20.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.34,0:55:21.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.61,0:55:23.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.27,0:55:25.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 看这边
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.56,0:55:27.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真的看过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.30,0:55:38.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.10,0:55:41.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,扔点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.10,0:55:45.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拔鼻毛？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.00,0:55:48.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,扔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.00,0:55:50.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,扔？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.90,0:55:51.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,总之先扔点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.48,0:55:55.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不行不行 有那些人在 不可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.20,0:55:58.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快点扔
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.98,0:56:01.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真的要扔吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.50,0:56:03.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快点给我扔
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.24,0:56:16.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好可爱 好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.27,0:56:17.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,弄得我都心跳加速了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.32,0:56:20.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,以后再给你买更贵的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.28,0:56:21.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.93,0:56:35.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,再见啦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.43,0:56:51.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,八七六
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.29,0:56:55.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,八四七六
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.36,0:56:57.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有联系电话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.16,0:57:12.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.96,0:57:30.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.49,0:57:37.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.61,0:57:41.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.61,0:57:44.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,把门卡放到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.89,0:57:49.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.99,0:57:51.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.19,0:57:56.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们对我哥哥做了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.69,0:57:59.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么要杀我哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.03,0:58:03.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不说清楚 我绝不会交给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.69,0:58:33.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 走了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.19,0:58:39.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别磨磨蹭蹭的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.67,0:59:04.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那边
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.67,0:59:06.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,安静地等着
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.21,0:59:10.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,敢出一点声 我就杀了人质
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.24,0:59:14.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.24,0:59:15.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.25,0:59:17.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我很强
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.25,0:59:19.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,救出人质 再逮捕犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.99,0:59:22.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,大内先生 请别擅自冲进去
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.96,0:59:23.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.79,0:59:25.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.18,0:59:26.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我很强
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.99,0:59:31.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在给你们发钱
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.76,0:59:33.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,每人两百万
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.76,0:59:35.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,先拿着
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.39,0:59:39.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,两百万
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.00,0:59:52.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.29,0:59:53.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我很强
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.33,0:59:55.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,救出人质 逮捕犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.56,0:59:58.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拿着
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.16,0:59:58.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.97,1:00:02.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拿钱
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.53,1:00:04.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.53,1:00:05.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.03,1:00:06.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拿着
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.02,1:00:08.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拿着
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.46,1:00:10.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个……
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.46,1:00:11.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.19,1:00:12.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我还有个同伴
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.70,1:00:14.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可以的话 也给他一份
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.66,1:00:17.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哪儿都没人啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.89,1:00:18.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别耍花样
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.83,1:00:19.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拿着
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.89,1:00:22.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好 现在放你们出去
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.45,1:00:27.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过有个条件 都给我听清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.16,1:00:32.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,出去时 必须双手把成捆钞票举过头顶
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.62,1:00:36.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一边用力挥舞 一边跑
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.27,1:00:38.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,限时五秒
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.18,1:00:42.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,外面全是警察 但你们要全力冲出去
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.42,1:00:49.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果快被警察抓住 就把成捆钞票抛向空中
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.08,1:00:50.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,让钞票散得到处都是
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.47,1:00:54.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不照我说的做 就“砰”！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.72,1:00:57.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啧 我要杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.32,1:01:01.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快把钱举起来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.42,1:01:03.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在开始
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.29,1:01:05.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,开始
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.96,1:01:06.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.62,1:01:10.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.62,1:01:11.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,报告
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.56,1:01:13.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么样 怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.09,1:01:16.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,冷静点
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.09,1:01:17.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,冷静点
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.81,1:01:57.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊 等等……
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.50,1:02:01.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,冷静点
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.50,1:02:01.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,冷静
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.71,1:02:02.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.52,1:02:03.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警察来了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.22,1:02:06.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是警察
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.22,1:02:09.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,后来怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.84,1:02:22.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.84,1:02:23.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.36,1:02:29.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.36,1:02:30.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.11,1:02:30.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.86,1:02:32.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 你听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.36,1:02:37.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.76,1:02:41.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师为什么会来案发现场？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.82,1:02:44.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助明明说过不干了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.16,1:02:48.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,先别管这些 到底发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.12,1:02:50.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,门禁卡
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.16,1:02:52.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,门禁卡？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.24,1:02:53.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.24,1:02:58.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那些人的真正目标 是保险柜里的门禁卡
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.82,1:03:02.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.39,1:03:05.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助同学
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.86,1:03:07.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊 还有狭山老师
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.66,1:03:31.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,办得怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.19,1:03:41.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯 虽然出了点小麻烦 但大体上没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.68,1:03:53.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这幅画是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.58,1:03:56.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是下一起犯罪的关键词
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.91,1:03:57.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.18,1:04:03.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你可能不信 但这个孩子看得见
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.63,1:04:04.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.63,1:04:06.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.09,1:04:10.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一个卷入犯罪的人所看到的影像
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.56,1:04:12.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,会映现在爱之助的左眼里
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.39,1:04:16.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.19,1:04:20.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可以确定 这幅画里的建筑与下一起犯罪有关
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.43,1:04:24.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.43,1:04:27.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊 啊 是这个
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.06,1:04:29.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是我家附近的建筑
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.86,1:04:30.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.37,1:04:32.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是什么建筑？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.14,1:04:35.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,国立病毒研究中心
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.14,1:04:37.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.40,1:04:46.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,通知所有搜查员
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.37,1:04:49.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,抢劫犯团伙目前仍在逃
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.25,1:04:51.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,疑似 4 名年轻男子
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.66,1:04:54.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,因为很可能混在人质中
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.02,1:04:57.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以所有男性暂时请随我们回警署
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.21,1:05:01.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我也要？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.61,1:05:04.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我怎么可能是犯人呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.84,1:05:08.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,比起这个 快去加强那个病毒研究中心的警戒啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.85,1:05:10.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.09,1:05:12.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,光凭那幅画 警察没法行动
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.67,1:05:13.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,必须拿出确凿的证据
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.50,1:05:21.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,大内先生 能打扰一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.72,1:05:22.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.39,1:05:24.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是鉴识科的报告
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.59,1:05:26.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,枪和面具 还有其他目击证词……
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.49,1:05:38.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.49,1:05:40.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,禁止入内
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.41,1:05:54.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好 那就从你为什么会去那家银行开始说吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.00,1:05:56.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.00,1:05:57.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.08,1:05:59.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,刚才那台电脑是谁的？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.30,1:06:01.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.36,1:06:05.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道你是今天银行抢劫案的相关人员？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.36,1:06:08.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不能说
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.36,1:06:10.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那你为什么去那家银行？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.66,1:06:13.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,既然不能说 那就是猜中了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.97,1:06:16.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以我不能说
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.75,1:06:19.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警方如此大规模地搜查
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.36,1:06:23.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道那个人就是犯罪组织的首领？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.58,1:06:26.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.58,1:06:28.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,原来是首领
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.56,1:06:29.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.56,1:06:32.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,都说了不能说 你还问什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.22,1:06:35.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请说
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.24,1:06:37.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这事请替我保密
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.76,1:06:41.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这种人被称为“犯罪策划人”
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.43,1:06:42.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯罪策划人
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.64,1:06:45.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这种洋气的职业名称真不错呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.29,1:06:49.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,既是策划师 又有点像首领
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.93,1:06:54.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那种人的收入是不是很高呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.20,1:06:57.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那就是这么回事了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.89,1:07:00.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个人一定非常聪明
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.55,1:07:08.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,明明这么聪明 为什么还要犯罪呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.17,1:07:16.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是我的自言自语 不过我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.70,1:07:20.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,绝对无法原谅
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.31,1:07:24.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,世上大多数人都是凡人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.84,1:07:26.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,根本没有什么能称为才能的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.87,1:07:29.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我自认为也比别人努力
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.54,1:07:33.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可直到现在 写文件时每页还是会错 3 处
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.97,1:07:38.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一到现场 我就热血上头 总是做过头
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.03,1:07:41.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过 那台电脑的主人恐怕不一样
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.08,1:07:48.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他天生就从父母那里继承了非凡的聪明头脑
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.99,1:07:52.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可他却把它用来犯罪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.04,1:07:57.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,明明拥有能为社会做贡献的才能
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.18,1:07:59.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,却拿来满足一己私欲
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.73,1:08:04.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是世上真有神
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.85,1:08:08.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哪怕只把他一半的才能给我就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.71,1:08:14.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那样我就能成为更优秀的刑警 为社会做贡献了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.42,1:08:20.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,自言自语结束
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.30,1:08:23.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好了 接下来轮到你了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.13,1:08:30.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,从为什么会去银行开始 按顺序告诉我
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.42,1:08:53.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.42,1:08:55.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个少年的预言应验了！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.99,1:08:56.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.12,1:09:04.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,东京的各位 大家好
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.61,1:09:08.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我正在通过电视进行现场直播
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.05,1:09:18.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我现在在国立病毒研究中心
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.40,1:09:24.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们知道我手里的这个胶囊吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.88,1:09:30.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,它叫 K2Z 病毒
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.27,1:09:33.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要打碎这个……
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.85,1:09:36.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那家伙就是当时逃跑的人吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.32,1:09:42.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没想到 竟然真的如爱之助君所说
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.36,1:09:44.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,会死人的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.71,1:09:49.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.79,1:09:56.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,锵锵
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.89,1:10:03.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,国立病毒研究中心所长 杉森先生
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.74,1:10:06.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,说话啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.61,1:10:12.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,各位 这个胶囊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.67,1:10:16.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,很遗憾 是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.67,1:10:21.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这个胶囊里装着
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.59,1:10:26.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一种名为 K2Z 病毒的可怕剧毒病毒
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.99,1:10:31.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,K2Z病毒在已知病原体中
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.79,1:10:33.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,空气传播能力格外强
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.74,1:10:37.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这一点广为人知……
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.21,1:10:39.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这么一点点……
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.69,1:10:43.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要吸入粉尘 就能致人死亡
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.49,1:10:45.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,即使只是微量
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.70,1:10:49.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也能夺走 1000 万人以上的生命
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.43,1:10:50.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是种可怕的病毒
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.80,1:10:59.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,刚才银行抢劫的人质只有 30 人
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.53,1:11:03.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可这次增加到了 1200 万人
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.18,1:11:09.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警视总监先生 听到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.23,1:11:15.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,1200 万人质的性命 你们要付多少钱？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.08,1:11:17.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请在 5 分钟内回答
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.54,1:11:24.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没有答复的话 我就打碎这个胶囊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.27,1:11:28.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有 出价太低我也会打碎
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.33,1:11:37.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,计时开始
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.43,1:11:42.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.25,1:11:44.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,刚才那个
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.52,1:11:46.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.15,1:11:49.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.24,1:11:51.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.71,1:11:55.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,之前的资讯节目也报道过吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.04,1:11:59.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,听说那个研究中心里放着好几种危险细菌
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.58,1:12:01.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不知道有没有防毒面具之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.03,1:12:04.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,从这里到那个研究中心 只有两三公里吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.90,1:12:07.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也就是说 胶囊一碎 我们大概 5 分钟就会死
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.57,1:12:10.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们别胡闹！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.64,1:12:12.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们可是刑警
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.64,1:12:14.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别做这种丢人的事
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.96,1:12:16.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,出了案子就要去现场
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.26,1:12:17.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这才是刑警吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.09,1:12:20.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不管是什么案件都一样
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.28,1:12:29.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助君 抱歉 我不该怀疑你说的话
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.79,1:12:32.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,刑警先生
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.94,1:12:35.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是很遗憾 已经太迟了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.00,1:12:39.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你和老师现在马上尽可能撤到远处去
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.38,1:12:42.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,大内先生真的要去吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.93,1:12:45.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,因为我是刑警
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.19,1:12:48.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好了 你们两个快撤离
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.19,1:12:52.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人应该不至于打碎那个
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.69,1:12:54.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可现场会发生什么 谁也不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.68,1:12:56.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.68,1:12:57.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.58,1:12:58.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,剩下的交给你了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.18,1:13:00.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.85,1:13:03.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,刑警先生
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.76,1:13:06.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请相信我
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.24,1:13:12.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果你相信我 能不能只答应我一个任性请求？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.51,1:13:14.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.66,1:13:23.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这种事？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.96,1:13:25.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托了 刑警先生
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.05,1:13:28.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.02,1:13:32.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那我走了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.72,1:13:45.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我很强
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.21,1:13:47.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我不会逃
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.71,1:13:50.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我才不会死 我要逮捕犯人
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.37,1:13:55.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们刚才在说悄悄话？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.60,1:13:57.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好好解释一下
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.03,1:13:58.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,再打我一次
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.86,1:13:59.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哈？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.46,1:14:03.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这一切可能全都是谎言
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.19,1:14:06.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以 能不能好好说明？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.30,1:14:07.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没时间了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.56,1:14:09.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.45,1:14:15.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人团伙指定的时限就要到了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.57,1:14:30.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我国的警视总监似乎没有任何回应
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.83,1:14:35.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,连东京都的各位也被小看得够呛
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.40,1:14:41.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊 那边的记者
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.26,1:14:47.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,马上去和警视总监当面交涉 直接闯到他那里去
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.48,1:14:53.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.08,1:14:55.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我相信爱之助
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.31,1:14:58.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托你全力以赴
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.52,1:15:02.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在那之前 能问一件事吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.40,1:15:05.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.88,1:15:12.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你啊 当中学生实在太可惜了 帅得不像话
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.20,1:15:23.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 接通了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.60,1:15:30.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他说现在正在开会 希望再多一点时间考虑
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.88,1:15:33.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,各位 听到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.48,1:15:40.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警察最高层都这么没有决断力
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.60,1:15:43.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,国家治安怎么守得住？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.60,1:15:45.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以日本才不行
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.68,1:15:47.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊 对了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.68,1:15:53.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,忘了说 我一点也不怕死
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.68,1:15:59.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,死的时候 要和大家一起
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.00,1:16:03.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好 游戏结束
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.13,1:16:04.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.28,1:16:55.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.30,1:16:56.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.28,1:17:06.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现场那边……
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.34,1:17:07.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警察正在撤离！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.40,1:17:08.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,胶囊……
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.20,1:17:10.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,胶囊碎了！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.99,1:17:16.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就是这样吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.52,1:17:27.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,糟了 糟了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.59,1:17:37.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 出来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.59,1:17:38.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.28,1:17:39.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.48,1:17:40.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.08,1:17:42.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快出去！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.61,1:17:52.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.61,1:17:53.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.45,1:17:54.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.21,1:17:55.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.01,1:17:56.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谁啊 喂 怎么不出来？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.14,1:19:58.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.09,1:20:03.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.77,1:20:06.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么会这样？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.44,1:20:12.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是哥哥吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.27,1:20:35.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么是哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.00,1:20:40.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我有点对你刮目相看了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.09,1:20:42.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,竟然没和大家一起逃
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.08,1:20:46.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,因为我以为你会来拿电脑
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.34,1:20:51.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你是想把警察局的人都调走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.46,1:20:54.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以才设计了这么复杂的一出戏
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.92,1:20:57.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.33,1:20:58.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.99,1:21:01.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你在国立病毒研究中心说过话
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.18,1:21:05.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那时我就认出是哥哥了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.50,1:21:10.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这副面具明明是请专家特制的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.28,1:21:16.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,脸的确骗过我了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.29,1:21:19.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但那双手是哥哥的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.14,1:21:22.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,手？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.98,1:21:30.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那是以前我和哥哥约定的暗号
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.69,1:21:33.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.69,1:21:36.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好像确实有这么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.48,1:21:38.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“没事
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.78,1:21:40.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一切顺利”
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.99,1:21:44.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个手势就是这个意思
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.23,1:21:48.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥不是会自杀的人
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.14,1:21:50.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那答案就只有一个
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.27,1:21:53.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个胶囊是假的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.76,1:21:57.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,猜得不错
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.92,1:22:00.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过这主意很棒吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.89,1:22:03.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,大家吓得惊慌失措 全都逃了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.70,1:22:05.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,人类真是愚蠢啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.07,1:22:11.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.14,1:22:13.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不好笑吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.47,1:22:15.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一点也不好笑
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.15,1:22:17.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.15,1:22:20.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我可是一直都想试试
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.45,1:22:25.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,说实话 如果只是拿回电脑 我有的是更好的办法
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.41,1:22:34.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一直以为哥哥被人杀了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.41,1:22:42.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你知道我有多难过吗 哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.54,1:22:49.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我也是作为哥哥 替你着想才这么做的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.91,1:22:51.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,再怎么伤心
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.96,1:22:56.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也总比这样让你知道我是窃贼和杀人犯要好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.54,1:22:59.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,杀人犯？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.01,1:23:02.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂喂
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.32,1:23:06.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,既然我还活着 那死掉的当然是另一个人
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.27,1:23:11.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,顺便说 他叫滨田 是我的助手
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.62,1:23:17.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他为了点小钱偷了我的电脑 我就杀一儆百
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.43,1:23:20.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,把他杀了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.90,1:23:28.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,晚上好
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.07,1:23:29.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是杀手
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.93,1:23:34.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没被任何人看见吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.43,1:23:36.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.42,1:23:56.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.56,1:23:57.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还在工作？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.81,1:24:00.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还在研究室吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.66,1:24:03.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我看了信封 发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.72,1:24:06.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥 这些钱是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.04,1:24:08.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就当是给弟弟的 不行吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.93,1:24:10.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别管了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.75,1:24:11.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.04,1:24:14.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,总之 我的左眼已经能看见了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.59,1:24:18.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有 有句话我一直没好好说
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.86,1:24:21.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 哥
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.09,1:24:25.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真的谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.24,1:24:33.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥杀了人？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.76,1:24:37.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.76,1:24:41.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你是被坏人威胁的吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.06,1:24:48.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你被坏人威胁 迫不得已才帮他们做事 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.90,1:24:54.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,善与恶
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.90,1:24:57.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,究竟哪一个才是真的 你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.50,1:25:03.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,稍微想想就轻松得出了答案
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.22,1:25:06.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,跟我的研究相比 简直太容易了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.84,1:25:10.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正确答案是恶
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.50,1:25:12.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,骗人
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.50,1:25:15.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,当然是善更好
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.99,1:25:25.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,与其只为自己做坏事 当然是为了别人努力更好
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.34,1:25:30.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一直都很崇拜哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.61,1:25:35.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你一边照顾我 一边自学考上大学
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.54,1:25:40.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,后来还成了大公司的开发人员 我一直很尊敬你
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.14,1:25:44.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对 问题就在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.65,1:25:50.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是理科生嘛 凡事不亲自试试就无法信服
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.44,1:25:52.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,试试？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.94,1:25:55.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是左眼
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.16,1:25:57.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我给你的那只左眼
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.14,1:26:04.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我做了我能想到的最好的事
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.85,1:26:08.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,把我珍贵的角膜给了弟弟
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.59,1:26:13.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我还兴奋地等着看自己会发生什么变化
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.64,1:26:20.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是 什么变化都没有
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.43,1:26:26.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来人的本性果然是邪恶的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.89,1:26:32.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你知道印度天才数学家拉马努金吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.12,1:26:37.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他说是女神教给了他数学公式
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.59,1:26:44.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而我的女神 会把邪恶的点子告诉我
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.83,1:26:47.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.83,1:26:54.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,顺便说 这不是抢银行或细菌恐袭计划
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.39,1:26:57.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是更精彩的犯罪
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.09,1:26:59.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥 快住手吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.39,1:27:04.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这台电脑里的计划 我会继续执行
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.49,1:27:05.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.69,1:27:09.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你能杀了我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.94,1:27:20.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,先告诉你 我能杀了你
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.54,1:27:40.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,骗人
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.04,1:27:51.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.54,1:28:02.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,接下来
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.74,1:28:10.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我会亲手把哥哥的计划一个不剩地摧毁
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.34,1:28:14.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哦 你以为自己能赢过我？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.95,1:28:15.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,当然能
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.95,1:28:21.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,因为我有哥哥给我的左眼
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.34,1:28:23.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哈？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.54,1:28:41.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有本事就试着摧毁它
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.49,1:28:46.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过到时候被我杀了 可别后悔
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.54,1:29:10.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我能摧毁
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.82,1:29:16.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,因为我刚才用这只左眼看到了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.14,1:29:22.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看到了哥哥接下来要犯的罪
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.08,1:29:44.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那家伙 那家伙 竟然动手了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.12,1:29:46.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.89,1:29:49.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是假的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.96,1:29:59.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真的没事吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.16,1:30:01.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.36,1:30:05.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,虽然我刚才被骚乱中的人群踩踏
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.20,1:30:08.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,骨头断了 但我的心没断
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.11,1:30:16.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过 他们还真是一群会惹事的家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.50,1:30:18.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,病毒也是假的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.72,1:30:20.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过 爱之助 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.20,1:30:24.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,多亏你的机灵 让犯人拿到了假货
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.39,1:30:29.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我想把那台电脑换成假的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.59,1:30:30.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.59,1:30:33.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那台电脑不是用密码锁链锁着吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.69,1:30:35.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请告诉我密码
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.55,1:30:37.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别说这种话
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.86,1:30:38.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托了 警察先生
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.19,1:30:43.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.95,1:31:08.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一定会破解你拼命保护下来的那台电脑
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.45,1:31:12.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,并粉碎犯罪团伙的计划
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.21,1:31:14.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.04,1:31:21.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对了 虽然有点啰嗦 但犯人的长相呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.58,1:31:26.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.21,1:31:31.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不不 爱之助同学 你已经做得很好了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.18,1:31:32.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真的谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.08,1:31:36.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警察先生 你既然说了“谢谢”
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.32,1:31:38.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是不是该给点谢礼什么的？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.98,1:31:39.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,开个玩笑
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.82,1:31:43.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这个嘛……
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.16,1:31:44.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,说我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.16,1:31:46.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没有吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.78,1:31:47.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.78,1:31:48.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警察先生
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.73,1:31:49.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,疼 好疼
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.53,1:31:51.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,住手 住手
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.53,1:31:52.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我已经很努力了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.83,1:31:55.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,心没有折断 但骨头断了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.23,1:31:56.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,骨头也断了
